        {
          "id": "4e30e4c",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Owning a boat has many advantages, but when a part breaks or goes missing sometimes the hardest part can be finding a replacement.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft Products can supply you with a wide range of products in sheets, rods, and tubing. We are also custom fabricators, so let our CNC routers and fabrication equipment provide you with high-quality components and replacement parts for all your boating needs.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "a2a77e6",
